  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile RNA-only models (config_002) outperform singleprofile baselines (config_001) with avgpool aggregation. This experiment tests whether switching to scvi_n200 RNA encoder (vs pca_n2000 in config_002) further improves performance while keeping multiprofile and avgpool settings. This isolates the impact of RNA representation choices, which remains uncertain despite the multiprofile benefit. It balances exploitation of the multiprofile advantage with exploration of encoder variations, avoiding unnecessary changes to aggregation or profile settings."
}

